# AgentiHooks user environment
#
# agentihooks init renders the owned settings and current defaults into
# ~/.agentihooks/.env. The canonical ownership manifest is:
#
#   profiles/_base/env.defaults.json
#
# Brain settings belong in ~/.agentibrain/.env. Harness settings belong in
# Claude, Codex, or Copilot native configuration. Bundled GitHub, AWS, SMTP,
# database, webhook, and similar connector credentials belong in their
# connector-specific environment files.
